    "q-119467": {
      "dom_id": "step-q119467",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Find the value of $\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{5}{6}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Since both fractions have the same denominators, we can combine them into one fraction, which gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{5}{6}=\\frac{1-5}{6}.\n$$\n\nNow, we work out $1-5$ using a number line:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14148354/assets/ac5c43b0ae0187245b0b5f308335e2797483f62afba727e7b64f1bc1dceced77.png)\n\nSo, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{1-5}{6}=\\frac{-4}{6}=-\\frac{4}{6}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify:\n\n$$\n-\\frac{4}{6}=-\\frac{4÷2}{6÷2}=-\\frac{2}{3}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{5}{6}=-\\frac{2}{3}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-119467-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{2}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-119467-b",
