    "q-42713": {
      "dom_id": "step-q42713",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Calculate the value of $\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{7}{4}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We write $\\frac{1}{2}$ as $\\frac{2}{4}$ and then we simply subtract the numerators. This gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{4}-\\frac{7}{4}=\\frac{2-7}{4}.\n$$\n\nNow, we work out $2-7$ using a number line:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14148354/assets/eea536f581897431a30a8bdadabe7d02fc1f5fc783af2221fda4b2e7f9d6d936.png)\n\nSo we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{2-7}{4}=\\frac{-5}{4}=-\\frac{5}{4}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
